{"source":"github","project_id":"parsedate","target":"gaborcsardi/parsedate","id":"pr/7","ref":7,"title":"fixed issue with missing prefix in regexp_to_df","description":"I encountered the following issue when parsing vectors with missing values:\n\n\u003e library(parsedate)\n\u003e dates \u003c- c(\"\", \"1985-09-02T12:00:00\", \"1973-07-13T12:00:00\")\n\u003e parse_iso_8601(dates)\n\u003e [1] NA                        NA                        \"1985-09-02 12:00:00 UTC\"\n","published_at":"2015-03-13T20:59:03Z","updated_at":"2015-03-13T21:05:45Z","url":"https://github.com/gaborcsardi/parsedate/pull/7","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"pieterprovoost","merged_at":"2015-03-13T21:05:45Z","state":"MERGED"}}
